#            Now: bytes / regex / time / process / int_range / env_get /
#            term_read_line / http_* / typeclass_*  all flow through.
#   PR 15a — Bool ctor field zext wiring (IRZextI1ToI64)  ✓ this PR
#             Cleared 3 entries: json_demo, sentry_api,
#             test_constrained_container_dispatch.
#             2 entries shifted to new blockers (see below).
#   PR 15b — WrapDecl ctor registration in ast_to_ir (build_ctor_table_acc,
#             translate_match_arm_ctor, translate_boxed_ctor_call)  ✓ this PR
#             0 entries fully cleared; 5 entries shifted to new blockers:
#               test_wrap_type      → translate_do drops sealed blocks from non-last
#                                     do steps (IR invalid: undefined arm_0_N predecessor)
